; What V-0 must REFUSE, not mistranslate.
;
; `resume` is an EFFECT instruction: the IR has one-shot continuations, v2 Core IR has no
; counterpart, and there is no honest lowering. The bridge must say so and name it.
;
; This fixture held `globget` until 2026-08-04, when globals became translatable and the check went
; red — the gate noticing its own probe had gone stale is the gate working. The replacement must be
; re-pointed the same way if effects ever land on the bridge.
(module
  (consts (int 1))
  (types)
  (globals)
  (prims)
  (funcs
    (func "main" 0 2
      (const 1 0)
      (resume 0 1 1)
      (ret 0)))
  (entry 0))
